  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to media organisation Democratic Voice of Burma (DVB)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Continuing support to the Democratic Voice of Burma (DVB), a former media organisation based in Oslo, as a part of support for independent media in Myanmar. DVB targets programming in such a ways as to encourage democratic development, respect for human rights, and increased focus on gender equality.</narrative>
  </description>
